title: International Relations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: international_relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; international_relations_timer += 4;
card-image: img/sosyalistenternasyonal.jpg
#subtitle: Building ties with our fraternal socialist parties.

= International Relations

Although the "Left of Center" movement currently dominating the party is an indigenous leftist movement shaped to address the needs of the Turkish nation, it has been significantly influenced by European Social Democratic movements.

- @fr_uk: The Western European Social Democrats, including the SPD and Labour, have provided significant inspiration for our movement. Strengthening these relationships could benefit both our nation and our party.
- @baath: Although we remain firmly opposed to undemocratic forms of socialism, it is notable that Kemalism continues to serve as a model for many Baathists in the Arab world.
- @international: The Socialist International is a broad coalition of Democratic Left parties. Developing closer ties, and potentially pursuing membership, could offer significant advantages for our party.
- @join_socialist_international: [? if western_socialist_contacts >= 4 : We have built enough contacts to formally join the Socialist International! ?]
- @america: İnönü once referred to the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**CHP**</span> as the Democrats of Turkey. It is worth considering whether we can restore our relationship with our allies in the United States.
- @return: We do not need international contacts at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@fr_uk
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} resources -= 1; west_relation += 3; {! AnatolianRules.adjustFactionStrength(Q, 'lk', 5); !}  western_socialist_contacts += 1

We have improved our relations with our Western partners and albeit very slightly, seen a shift in their attitude.

@baath
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} resources -= 1; middle_east_relation += 10 if orthodox_kemalists_strength >= 24; left_kemalists_dissent += 5

Even though we are opposed to undemocratic forms of socialism, we still took the pragmatic route of contacting our "allies" down South.
[? if orthodox_kemalists_strength < 24: The Baath parties no longer view us as ideological allies, our efforts go in vain as our delegates are accused of being puppets of European "soft leftism". ?]

@international
view-if: not socialist_international_member
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1 and western_socialist_contacts < 4
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources < 1 : Not enough resources. ?][? if western_socialist_contacts >= 4 : We have enough contacts to join the Socialist International. ?]
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} resources -= 1; TIP_relation += 5*(1-dissent); {! AnatolianRules.adjustFactionStrength(Q, 'lk', 5); !}  western_socialist_contacts += 1

We have contacted the Socialist International. Even though the first remarks were positive, more work needs to be done.

@join_socialist_international
subtitle: -1 resources, Join the Socialist International!
view-if: western_socialist_contacts >= 4 and not socialist_international_member
choose-if: resources >= 1 and socialist_international_member == 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} resources -= 1; TIP_relation += 10*(1-dissent); {! AnatolianRules.adjustFactionStrength(Q, 'lk', 10); !}  west_relation += 10; socialist_international_member = 1

Our extensive diplomatic efforts have finally paid off! The Socialist International has formally accepted the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**CHP**</span> as a member party. This historic achievement strengthens our international standing and creates new opportunities for cooperation with fellow Democratic Left parties.

@america
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} resources -= 1

Our attempts at fostering productive bonds with the Democrats fail as they are frustrated with our recent political moves.

@return

We do not need the international contacts at the moment.
